-- title:
--   The default election strategy is monotone
-- statement:
--   `ElectionStrategy.DEFAULT_INSTANCE.Monotone`: for all arguments and all vote collections `v` and `w` such that every id of `v` is an id of `w`, if the default strategy's additional constraint holds for `v` then it holds for `w`. The default strategy, the only one in OpenSearch itself, imposes no additional constraint: it is the constant `true`.
